{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女星宋慧喬於6月離開合作14年的UAA事務所後，其後落實簽約AAP事務所前CEO申載浩成立的新經紀公司，男方正是她的造型師丈夫，而申載浩成立的STAND事務所今日公開宋慧喬的新造型照，宣布與宋慧喬簽約的消息。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.374768+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:04:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_hash":"caec3087adc79bf8b80b5a330420d314eab9ce6b24ea14187cd0fc3655eb52e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}